  <p id="c-liangshu-029-luling-xiao-xu:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">廬陵威王<persName id="c-liangshu-029-luling-xiao-xu:p001:m0004" ref="fo7_f8v_rmf_G">續</persName>字<persName id="c-liangshu-029-luling-xiao-xu:p001:m0006" ref="fo7_f8v_rmf_G">世䐶</persName>，<persName id="c-liangshu-029-luling-xiao-xu:p001:m0009" ref="fo7_f8v_rmf">高祖</persName>第五子，天監八年，封廬陵郡王，邑二千戶。</p>
  <p id="c-liangshu-029-luling-xiao-xu:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">五年，爲驃騎將軍、開府儀同三司。</p>
